    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the project: Emplorer.<br />\r\nYou will be piloting a micro-robot to explore the inside of an animal.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExploring life will not be easy.<br />\r\nDefeat the various immune cells that attack you to move forward.<br />\r\nWhen you reach your destination, move to the next stage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have to fire bullets at specific timing to do higher damage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you stimulate the immune cells too much, your test subject's body temperature will rise.<br />\r\nBe careful, because bad things happen when the body temperature is too high.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your robot to become more powerful as a reward for your work.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nManage your resources properly to get the job done efficiently.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey features:<br />\r\n- Diverse enemies<br />\r\n- Biological tissue-themed stages<br />\r\n- Various stat upgrades as you progress through the stages",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to the project: Emplorer.<br />\r\nYou will be piloting a micro-robot to explore the inside of an animal.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExploring life will not be easy.<br />\r\nDefeat the various immune cells that attack you to move forward.<br />\r\nWhen you reach your destination, move to the next stage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have to fire bullets at specific timing to do higher damage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you stimulate the immune cells too much, your test subject's body temperature will rise.<br />\r\nBe careful, because bad things happen when the body temperature is too high.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your robot to become more powerful as a reward for your work.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nManage your resources properly to get the job done efficiently.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey features:<br />\r\n- Diverse enemies<br />\r\n- Biological tissue-themed stages<br />\r\n- Various stat upgrades as you progress through the stages",
    "short_description": "You are the pilot of a micro-robot that travels through tissues, collecting 'samples' from the cells it kills and harvesting samples more efficiently.",
